ities.','other',3859.7,3862.2),(2632,78,3455,3458,'If a zoning agency creates a proof of ownership expectation for indigenous communities to show that they actually own the land and have lived there, this is a permissible interpretation. Because, fine, most people have documentation, like proving that they own a specific piece of land. And the zoning agency has the right to make that interpretation, because it\'s literally their job to set requirements about what you can use land for and all that. So it\'s a permissible interpretation, because that is what judges care about on their competitive.','other',3862.2,3887.1),(2633,78,3459,3459,'On our competitive, judges care about the best possible reading.','other',3887.1,3890.1),(2634,78,3460,3461,'So they have a broader master metrics that they want to draw from. So how competitive, probably have a greater likelihood they\'re able to cite indigenous communities, because you no longer just solely refer to what the agency says.','other',3890.1,3900),(2635,78,3462,3463,'Because that zoning agency was blocked in by, let\'s say, a bunch of oil corporations. And this brings me to my idea of influence.','other',3900,3905.5),(2636,78,3464,3464,'We told you that, sure, it might not be impossible for you to influence the courts and make the courts act in your way, but think about the high burden.','other',3905.5,3912.3),(2637,78,3465,3467,'Like, you have to keep changing, for example, like the place in which your jurisdiction is held. You have to keep shuffling court cases like the ones you leave. That is a lot of money and a lot of time.','other',3912.3,3922.6),(2638,78,3467,3467,'That is a lot of money and a lot of time.','other',3920.7,3922.6),(2639,78,3468,3470,'Compare this to administrative agencies. You fund the FDA\'s research into food, like food poisoning, for example, at Red 40. That directly skews the results from that research in your favor.','other',3922.6,3932.4),(2640,78,3471,3472,'Or, for example, you, for exam