 yeah uh and It about freedom choice of those who pay the rentals Let move to the first point which is about losing the opportunity to save those who are kidnapped So I going to say it cool Why are terrorism gurus and kidnapping people of women seeing it? They\'re generally kidnapped by ISIS or innocent children, they\'re kidnapped by terrorism. So, after that, in order to save them, the other people, parents, or populists, sometimes they state themselves that pay ransom to terrorists and that is the only way to save their children or those who are kidnapped for example, if they pay, of course, for example, we can find a case of Japanese gay, Japanese journalists kidnapped by ISIS If they went to Japanese government, they denied paying ransom, they are killed. No thank you, ladies and gentlemen. But if they paid ransom, they can say that those who were kidnapped, for example, in the Spanish government, or the European government, or the same journalist by paying ransom to ISIS, they actually have the case. It\'s reasonable to say that if we pay ransom to them, those who are kidnapped are released. And actually, we can save them. And of course, if they can\'t... No, thank you. After taking this plan, what will happen? Even though those who pay ransom have no responsibility for the children or their partners to be kidnapped, but they are criminalized to pay ransom. And after that, what happens? They cannot pay ransom, or sometimes terrorism kills the people. And of course terrorism is no use demanding ransom to the victims but they need money So actually that why they do ransom No thank you So what will happen? They start human trafficking They start over-trading by doing them by any means They want money So they do inhuman things more over So actually what will happen? Even though we can say that by paying ransom, they won\'t be saved. They will die, killed by terrorism. The important thing in this argument is that paying ransom is a certain way to save those who are kidnapped, I mean innocent people. And that\'s important in this first argument. So why should we prioritize not only the mass but the individual? Right, right, ladies and gentlemen. Of course we should, of course we need to protect mass citizens from bombing. But I mean, I say that in order to save mass citizens from a terrorism attack, we have another more effective plan to, for example, air bombing, a more direct plan to do that. So, really criminalizing the paying ransom is too far from their purpose. And that\'s why we shouldn\'t criminalize the payment ransom. Let\'s move on to the second one, which is the freedom choice. Where freedom choice is important? Let\'s look at two things. The first is that whether it\'s a rational choice or not, and the second is harm to others. First the rational choice In the case of children kidnapped by terrorism for the parents children is really important in existence So even if they pay ransom to terrorism as a child as a parent they want to save the children Because the parents have a duty to protect their children. So that is the rational choice to pay ransom to terrorism. And second case, the government paid ransom to release those who were kidnapped by paying ransom. is that also we can say that it is a rational choice because as the government, it\'s a duty to protect citizens and protect them from a serious situation. So we can say also in this case, we can say that it is a rational choice. And let\'s move on to the second point, which is harm to others. Of course, firstly, we don\'t know how to use the... We don\'t know, of course, that it is uncertain that terrorism, how the terrorism uses their money to get from the ransomware. Moreover, they commit crimes, they commit human crimes, as I was saying, the kidnapping, because they need money, because of lack of money. Or if they have enough money, they don\'t do that. But it\'s a high risk to be arrested. It\'s high risk to be weakened. It\'s an organization. So we can say that because they don\'t have much money, because they need money, they start into human crimes. If we pay enough ransom to those terrorism groups, when we say totally, because the kidnappers, I mean terrorism, lose the motivation to have a risk, so totally we can say these cases, inhuman cases, will decrease. And that is why we vote this motion.\", \"words\": [{\"end\": 5.54, \"word\": \"Thank\", \"start\": 5.46}, {\"end\": 5.76, \"word\": \"you\", \"start\": 5.54}, {\"end\": 6.0, \"word\": \"Prime\", \"start\": 5.76}, {\"end\": 7.06, \"word\": \"Minister.\", \"start\": 6.0}, {\"end\": 8.24, \"word\": \"Now\", \"start\": 7.9}, {\"end\": 8.5, \"word\": \"I\", \"start\": 8.24}, {\"end\": 8.58, \"word\": \"will\", \"start\": 8.5}, {\"end\": 8.78, \"word\": \"call\", \"start\": 8.58}, {\"end\": 9.08, \"word\": \"upon\", \"start\": 8.78}, {\"end\": 9.3, \"word\": \"the\", \"start\": 9.08}, {\"end\": 9.44, \"word\": \"Leader\", \"start\": 9.3}, {\"end\": 9.62, \"word\": \"of\", \"start\": 9.44}, {\"end\": 9.76, \"word\": \"the\", \"start\": 9.62}, {\"end\": 10.08, \"word\": \"Opposition\", \"start\": 9.76}, {\"end\": 10.42, \"word\": \"to\", \"start\": 10.08}, {\"end\": 10.78, \"word\": \"open\", \"start\": 10.42}, {\"end\": 10.94, \"word\": \"their\", \"start\": 10.78}, {\"end\": 11.28, \"word\": \"case\", \"start\": 10.94}, {\"end\": 11.52, \"word\": \"in\", \"start\": 11.28}, {\"end\": 11.78, \"word\": \"seven\", \"start\": 11.52}, {\"end\": 12.4, \"word\": \"minutes.\", \"start\": 11.78}, {\"end\": 12.54, \"word\": \"Thank\", \"start\": 12.5}, {\"end\": 13.0, \"word\": \"you.\", \"start\": 12.54}, {\"end\": 35.08, \"word\": \"Ladies\", \"start\": 30.0}, {\"end\": 38.56, \"word\": \"and\", \"start\": 35.08}, {\"end\": 39.08, \"word\": \"gentlemen,\", \"start\": 38.56}, {\"end\": 39.24, \"word\": \"the\", \"start\": 39.08}, {\"end\": 39.4, \"word\": \"government\", \"start\": 39.24}, {\"end\": 39.76, \"word\": \"side\", \"start\": 39.4}, {\"end\": 39.94, \"word\":